{"name":"Bali Batik","hex":"#6f5937","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"batik","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A wax-resist method of dyeing fabric."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To dye fabric using the wax-resist method."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/batik"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bali","blocks":[{"text":"Bali is an Indonesian island and province and the westernmost of the Lesser Sunda Islands. East of Java and west of Lombok, the province includes the island of Bali and a few smaller offshore islands, notably Nusa Penida, Nusa Lembongan, and Nusa Ceningan to the southeast. The provincial capital, Denpasar, is the most populous city in the Lesser Sunda Islands and the second-largest, after Makassar, in Eastern Indonesia. The Denpasar metropolitan area is the extended metropolitan area around Denpasar. The upland town of Ubud in Greater Denpasar is considered as Bali's cultural centre. The province is Indonesia's main tourist destination, with a significant rise in tourism since the 1980s, and has become the country's area of overtourism. Tourism-related business makes up 80% of the Bali economy."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Bali_in_Indonesia_%28special_marker%29.svg/330px-Bali_in_Indonesia_%28special_marker%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bali","wikidata":"Q3125978"},{"title":"Batik","blocks":[{"text":"Batik is a dyeing technique using wax resist. The term is also used to describe patterned textiles created with that technique. Batik is made by drawing or stamping wax on a cloth to prevent colour absorption during the dyeing process. This creates a patterned negative when the wax is removed from the dyed cloth. Artisans may create intricate coloured patterns with multiple cycles of wax application and dyeing. Patterns and motifs vary widely even within countries. Some patterns hold symbolic significance and are used only in certain occasions, while others were created to satisfy market demand and fashion trends."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Batik_Trusmi_Cirebon_%2823%29.jpg/330px-Batik_Trusmi_Cirebon_%2823%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Batik","wikidata":"Q635427"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Official_seal_of_the_Province_of_Bali.png/500px-Official_seal_of_the_Province_of_Bali.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Official_seal_of_the_Province_of_Bali.png/1280px-Official_seal_of_the_Province_of_Bali.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Official_seal_of_the_Province_of_Bali.png/500px-Official_seal_of_the_Province_of_Bali.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOfficial_seal_of_the_Province_of_Bali.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Bali_panorama.jpg/500px-Bali_panorama.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Bali_panorama.jpg/500px-Bali_panorama.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Subak irrigation system has existed since the 9th century.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABali_panorama.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/1906_Puputan_monument_in_Denpasar.jpg/500px-1906_Puputan_monument_in_Denpasar.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/1906_Puputan_monument_in